    [feature]Adapting modelrunnerv1 to support the indexer mxfp4 feature of GLM 5.2 (#18060)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    The prerequisite PR is
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/17949. This PR adapts
    the li_c4 feature for GLM 5.2 within modelrunnerv1.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    no
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: pichangping <1337510399@qq.com>

